// ZEIG - helper: characteristic polynomial and eigenvalues of the square matrix [J].
// Out: ʟCP = coefficients of det(xI-A), highest power first (length N+1)
//      ʟEV = distinct eigenvalues (sorted high to low when all real)
//      ʟEC = the same eigenvalues as complex numbers (use when Z=1)
//      ʟAM = algebraic multiplicity of each, E = number of distinct eigenvalues
//      Z   = 1 if some eigenvalue is not real (calculator is then left in a+bi mode)
// Method: Faddeev-LeVerrier for the polynomial, Durand-Kerner for its roots, repeated
// roots are merged (cluster average) and snapped to simple fractions p/q, q<=12.
// Uses: N K I J L X Y V D B, [H] [G], ʟZD ʟZR ʟZU ʟZV ʟZW
dim([J])→ʟZD
ʟZD(1)→N
a+b𝑖
DelVar ʟCP
N+1→dim(ʟCP)
Fill(0,ʟCP)
1→ʟCP(1)
0*[J]→[H]
For(K,1,N)
[J]*[H]+ʟCP(K)*identity(N)→[H]
[J]*[H]→[G]
0→X
For(I,1,N)
X+[G](I,I)→X
End
⁻X/K→X
If abs(X-round(X,0))<1ᴇ⁻9*max(1,abs(X))
round(X,0)→X
X→ʟCP(K+1)
End
// ---- roots of the polynomial (Durand-Kerner) ----
0→B
For(I,1,N)
max(B,abs(ʟCP(I+1))^(1/I))→B
End
2*B+1→B
seq(B*(.4+.9𝑖)^(K-1),K,1,N)→ʟZR
For(L,1,100)
0→D
For(K,1,N)
ʟZR(K)→V
ʟCP(1)→Y
For(I,2,N+1)
Y*V+ʟCP(I)→Y
End
1→X
For(I,1,N)
If I≠K
X*(V-ʟZR(I))→X
End
If X≠0:Then
Y/X→Y
V-Y→ʟZR(K)
max(D,abs(Y))→D
End
End
If D<1ᴇ⁻11*B
100→L
End
// ---- merge repeated roots, snap to fractions ----
N→dim(ʟZU)
Fill(0,ʟZU)
DelVar ʟEV
DelVar ʟAM
0*ʟZR→ʟEC
N→dim(ʟEV)
N→dim(ʟAM)
0→E
0→Z
For(K,1,N)
If not(ʟZU(K)):Then
E+1→E
0→V
0→X
For(I,K,N)
If not(ʟZU(I)):Then
If abs(ʟZR(I)-ʟZR(K))<1ᴇ⁻3*max(1,abs(ʟZR(K))):Then
1→ʟZU(I)
V+ʟZR(I)→V
X+1→X
End
End
End
V/X→V
X→ʟAM(E)
If abs(imag(V))<1ᴇ⁻4*max(1,abs(V)):Then
real(V)→V
// polish: a root of multiplicity X is a simple root of the (X-1)th derivative
ʟCP→ʟZW
For(I,1,X)
If I>1
ʟZV→ʟZW
seq(ʟZW(J)*(dim(ʟZW)-J),J,1,dim(ʟZW)-1)→ʟZV
End
For(L,1,25)
ʟZW(1)→Y
For(I,2,dim(ʟZW))
Y*V+ʟZW(I)→Y
End
ʟZV(1)→D
For(I,2,dim(ʟZV))
D*V+ʟZV(I)→D
End
If D≠0
V-Y/D→V
End
If abs(V)<1ᴇ⁻9
0→V
For(I,1,12)
If abs(I*V-round(I*V,0))<1ᴇ⁻6*I:Then
round(I*V,0)/I→V
99→I
End
End
Else
1→Z
End
V→ʟEC(E)
real(V)→ʟEV(E)
End
End
E→dim(ʟEV)
E→dim(ʟAM)
E→dim(ʟEC)
If not(Z):Then
SortD(ʟEV,ʟAM)
Real
End
